    <string name="mentor_how">How it works</string>
    <string name="mentor_how_text">Each deed has a magic hour. Before it the page is quiet, and a charm cast then comes out in gold. At the magic hour the page lights up (a notification): now it\'s silver. If you had to remind them yourself, ring the bell here instead of raising your voice: the charm will be ink. A week of charms brews a potion on Sunday: a real reward from the shelf you fill together. Look through the day\'s pages here; a blot on a picture that isn\'t the deed takes its drops away.</string>
